--- a/packages/connector/README.md
+++ b/packages/connector/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,12 @@ The Node 24 LTS connector collects exact aggregate token counters from supported
 sources and pairs them with Vibe Racing agent accounts. It never uploads raw sessions or local
 paths.
 
+The protocol module validates every server response before returning it. Valid non-success responses
+reject with an `Error` whose `status` is the HTTP status and whose `code` is the validated server
+error code; malformed, oversized, non-JSON, or terminal-control-containing responses reject as
+`invalid_server_response` instead. The CLI uses those fields to preserve its existing cleanup and
+retry behavior.
+
 ```bash
 npx --yes --prefer-online --package https://viberacing.example/downloads/viberacing-connector.tgz -- \
   viberacing connect --origin https://viberacing.example
